{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_sleach_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_sleach_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"一雙羽獸","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_sleach_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"ee16220b4b58d684efbc8c73224bc94c771319aab01ba8159a4af2ec8026a058","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"為了祭奠自己的朋友，琴柳回到了小丘郡的廢墟之上，令她意想不到的是，還有人在那裡生活。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G6_decisivebattlealley_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，來到羅德島之前......我對我要遇到的事情都有預想，但當它們真的來臨，我才發現，所有的準備都無濟於事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作為軍人，哪怕只是一個小小的儀仗兵，一直以來我都堅信，生命是堅韌的，不應輕易流逝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可在這一年，我隨著本艦四處奔波，見識過太多人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太多人，他們離開得就像一陣不被察覺的風，你還沒意識到他們來過，他們就已經悄然遠去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼也沒能留下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我試圖記下那些面孔，那些在我面前逝去的生命，但是僅僅過去了一年，他們便也從我的記憶中離去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些您都經歷過，對嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可您也不會給我答案了，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看我，怎麼還跟以前一樣，一股腦兒地和您講這麼一大堆話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我今天帶了一束花給您，不過有點蔫了。因為沒有車隊願意來這裡，我只好徒步走過來，一路上花束很難保鮮。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（有人......？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，女士，請您稍做等待。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你，簡·薇洛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼在......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼知道我的名字？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別、別殺我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是阿奇頓！阿奇頓·庫徹！第五防衛隊，隸屬小丘郡駐軍第六營。你、你還記得嗎？就幾年前，我們見過的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿奇頓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我想起來了，我是有見過你。你怎麼在這裡？駐紮在此的軍隊不是早就撤走了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拉了拉袖子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的胳膊上......難道你們當時沒能從十七區撤離嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"髒彈投下來的時候，我們沒有一個人收到上級發出的撤退指令，或許是機器壞了，或許是長官忘記了，再或者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，務農人的常識不是嗎？拔除雜草的時候難免要殃及幾株麥苗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我很抱歉，阿奇頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒、沒關係。可是，簡，你又怎麼會在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我就是回來悼念一位故人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你呢，你就住在這片廢墟裡嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒，我們的營地在地塊外的荒地，剛剛我只是在廢墟裡找吃的，沒想到居然遇上了你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是，除了你，還有其他人生活在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，除了被留下的士兵，還有一些倖存的塔拉人在這裡流浪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事變後，軍隊想要找出倖存的感染者並將他們集中管控，為此組織過幾次搜查，但我們僥倖躲過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再後來，他們覺得這裡的損毀和污染都太過嚴重，於是決定徹底廢棄這個地塊，放任上面的人自生自滅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......你剛剛有找到什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（搖頭）哈，看來又得餓上幾天啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我身上帶了些口糧和藥品，你需要的話，都可以給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，簡妮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這裡有發信裝置嗎？如果我能聯繫上同事，我想他們或許願意幫忙送些物資過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我是有在廢墟裡看到過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在哪裡？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在不遠處，但那裡是塔拉人的活動範圍......我們兩個要是碰上那群人，恐怕很難辦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我們雙方勢同水火，但這樣的環境裡誰都很難，都不想再發生衝突了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以平時，如果能避開的話......我們都是儘量繞著對方走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿奇頓，給我指個方向吧，無論如何，我都得試試。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G5_victoria_street_n_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面的活性源石濃度已經超過安全範圍了......難道那些塔拉人就住在這種環境裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走了這麼久......一個人影也沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，那是？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士！請留步！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有惡意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這裡有些急救藥品和口糧，作為交換，我可以借用此地的發信裝置嗎？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦弱的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦弱的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"你剛剛說，你有藥品，是真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的。給，你看，如果你需要可以都拿走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦弱的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我過來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_u"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦弱的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"愛舍爾，我來了，我帶人來了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瀕死的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好痛......救救我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦弱的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的女兒，你的藥能救她嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......她的症狀實在是太嚴重了，急救藥品恐怕很難起效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦弱的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"試試吧，她還不到七歲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我盡力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愛舍爾，你能聽見我說話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（將針劑注射進女孩的身體）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，別緊張。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦弱的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，實在是......於事無補。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瀕死的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......好黑......媽媽，好......害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦弱的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"愛舍爾，愛舍爾，別怕，媽媽就在你身邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......對不起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我實在是......沒法子了，抱歉，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瀕死的女孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好冷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦弱的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"（抱緊女孩）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女士......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦弱的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"快走吧，別再來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些食物，我放在這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾天我在地塊外的荒地上住，如果你們有人需要幫助，可以來找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打擾了，我會儘早離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瘦弱的女人","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要借的設備就在對面的房子裡，自己去搬吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，小心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——沒想到你們的營地離地塊有這麼遠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼大的傢伙，你居然自己一個人就搬回來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了好了，別顧著感慨了，阿奇頓，我們還是先看看它到底還能不能用吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給你螺絲起子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很幸運，裡面構件完備，只需稍做調試就能使用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你居然還會這個？不可思議......什麼時候學的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只能說，從新的工作當中，我確實學到了很多東西。好了，螺絲起子還給你，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這就去把發電裝置連接上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，燈亮了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，順利啟動了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎麼找到這台設備的，那群塔拉人沒有為難你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，我拿隨身的物資和他們做了交換。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好，算他們識抬舉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿奇頓......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在物資送到之前，我們需要等待很長的時間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在這期間，我想開闢幾塊田地種植作物保證食物自給，總好過在地塊上搜尋，危險不說，效率也低。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好是好，可是......營地裡很多人的情況都不樂觀，能用的人手很少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有那些在地塊上遊蕩的塔拉人，我想讓他們也參與進來......如果能夠提供食物和淨水，他們應該不會拒絕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能，那些傢伙來到這裡第一件事就是幹掉我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿奇頓，我知道你們雙方的矛盾激烈，難以調和，但是現狀艱難，你們都別無選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只能給予你們一時的幫助，之後的路，還是需要你們自己走。而能夠和你們抱團一起前行的，也只有同為感染者的他們了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，要嘛暫時擱置前嫌，一起活下去；要嘛繼續抱恨，一起死在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再想想......我得問問其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿奇頓，我在尋找設備的路上，遇到了一個女人......我沒能救活她的女兒，但她還是為我指了路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說那個帶孩子的女人嗎？我知道她。怪不得......這些天都只看到她隻身一人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，接下來她要怎麼辦......她的丈夫、父母、姐妹都在那場浩劫中離開了，現如今......她的女兒也不在了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以阿奇頓，考慮下吧，他們也只是一群想要生存下去的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，查克，你信這些人的話嗎？我總覺得他們肯定留了一手將來要對付我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麻木的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_421_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道，也不想知道。幾天沒吃飯，我滿腦子只想吃些什麼墊一墊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是騙局，絕對的。要我說這些大頭兵肯定不安好心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麻木的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_421_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那又如何，說了那麼多，你不還是來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......那個瓦伊凡的手裡有抑制礦石病的藥物，我這幾天患處發作起來痛得厲害。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"營地的東面有簡易的淨水裝置，南面是我們即將開墾的田地，病患統一安置在北面的帳篷接受看護。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每天中午和晚上的時候，可以來營地中心領取一份食物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯咳......就只有這些了，簡妮，你還有什麼要說的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻煩問下諸位，有沒有見過一個女人，很瘦小，帶著一個女孩，但是孩子不久前去世了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"穆麗，你是說穆麗嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"褐色頭髮，眼睛下面有一顆小痣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"對，是她，你找她幹什麼？怎麼，她得罪你了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，我只是想問問她還好嗎?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"誰知道呢，好久沒看見她了，說不定也死在哪裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你們......我以為你們多多少少對彼此有些瞭解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"在這裡嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"瓦伊凡，在這裡，沒人有空閒關心別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼這麼看我，我說的......不過是實話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼，走了這麼久的路，辛苦大家了，儘早休息吧，明天還有很多事情等著我們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"簡妮，我不懂，你做這些的意義在哪裡？我們給了他們吃的東西，提供了住的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也沒期望他們能給我們什麼好臉色看，但是最起碼，相安無事總可以做到吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天倒好，聽說直接幹著活就打起來了，有個人現在還躺在床上呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......這果子也太高了，夠不到啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"簡妮、簡妮！你有在聽我說話嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？哦，那件事啊，我知道。是你的人先出言不遜的，阿奇頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰說的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"衝突發生的第一時間我就急忙趕去現場了，腦袋上挨了一拳的人也是我扶回去的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......你都問清楚了嗎，簡妮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。所以，為表歉意，不如就由你出面把這籃野果送給他們吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"難受的士兵病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好難受......琴柳小姐，我會死嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事的，我已經為你注射了止痛藥劑，稍做忍耐，一會就能起效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"難受的士兵病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝你，咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，有沒有好一些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"難受的士兵病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"能和我說些什麼嗎......我好怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想聽什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"難受的士兵病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什麼都行，我只是想......有個聲音能陪著我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，詩歌可以嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"難受的士兵病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“但願我們化作一雙白色的羽獸，出沒在浪尖。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“時光會將我們遺忘，悲傷亦不會再臨......”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麻木的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_421_1","isRemote":false,"text":"琴柳小姐......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噓，他睡著了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（謝謝你，查克先生，願意幫我們看顧這些人。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麻木的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_421_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沒事，你吃野果嗎？我給你拿一個。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（野果？你摘的嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麻木的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_421_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沒，一個大頭兵送來的，味道還可以。不知道他為什麼突然這麼好心。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（大概，是想為幾天前的事表示歉意吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麻木的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_421_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（誰信呢......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"難受的士兵病患","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......冷。"},{"type":"narration","text":"雖然面露不耐，男人還是動作輕柔地幫床上的病患掖好了被角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麻木的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_421_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘖，睡著都不老實。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_towerinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿奇頓，醒醒，快醒醒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，簡妮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"北面安置病患的帳篷漏水很嚴重，快叫起來幾個人跟我過去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？！等等，我馬上就來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快點，阿奇頓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來了，裡面的病患呢？你打算怎麼安排？該死，一淋雨，那幾個兄弟的病情肯定要惡化，這可怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔拉人第一時間過去了，估計他們已經轉移到其他的帳篷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，那些塔拉人已經及時把所有病患轉移走了，他們很安全！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"包括我們的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對，包括那些士兵，但是我帶來的那些藥品，沒能及時轉移，恐怕都泡水了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，我會想想辦法。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"21_G4_victoria_street_d_ruins"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你，德文，願意陪我來這裡尋找阿奇頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"別謝我，謝你手上的藥好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，我手上的藥已經不夠了，這幾天發放給大家的，都是阿奇頓帶人冒著風險在廢墟裡找到的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，煩死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，阿奇頓！你這個混蛋死哪裡去了，給老子吱一聲啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......我在這，我被困住了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有受傷嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒，就是出去的路塌了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"你沒事跑到這間地下室做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別廢話了，幫我一把，這有個受傷的女人昏迷不醒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我拉她上來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"這是穆麗......她居然還活著？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，你要吃司康嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"司康，你在逗我嗎？哪來的食材做這東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是簡妮搗鼓出來的，不知道她昨天從林子裡摘了些什麼回來，居然真的讓她做成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？給我一個嚐嚐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想不到啊，我居然還能在這裡吃上一口點心，之前我們明明連飯都吃不飽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"那丫頭帶著我們開了荒，養起了羽獸，救治病人她有一手，修建木屋她也能上。你看現在，甜點都讓她搗鼓出來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"趕緊吃你的吧！還要嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"不吃了，給穆麗留一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她怎麼樣了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"看著好多了，但還是不言不語的，失去孩子對她的打擊還是太大了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是辛苦簡妮了，這些時日一直陪在她身邊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，一說，這不就來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿奇頓先生！我收到同事給我的回覆了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"簡妮，這可真是太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......他們剛剛發來消息，說會從南部的辦事處緊急調用一部分物資運送過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那什麼時候送到？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"順利的話，估計一周後。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先別急著高興，我聽同事的意思，好像車隊那邊遇上了點麻煩？說是無法準確定位我們的位置，大概是信號的問題......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，我一會去地塊上找找，說不定能找到一台增幅設備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就麻煩你了。還有一件事，我們需要在營地中心豎一面旗子作為標識，與定位器一起配合，方便車隊靠近時能夠更準確地定位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"旗子？這有什麼好再思索的，隨便扯一塊鮮豔的布料掛上去不就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好歹要有個圖案吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"要圖案的話，乾脆去地塊上撿一塊以前的郡旗用得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，你不會還把自己當小丘郡的人看吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，要不把你們駐紮軍隊的旗幟拿來用，說不定地塊上也能找著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了......我這輩子都不想再看見那玩意兒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"得......那你倒是拿個主意啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"簡妮，你有什麼想法？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不清楚，這個得看大家的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，大家的想法就是，你的想法一定是最好的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......我也贊同。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snowconutryinside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，阿奇頓，這麼晚了還讓你和我一起做針線活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，你不嫌棄我手腳笨就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你愁眉苦臉的，不會還是在為旗子的事苦惱吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我今天在營地裡轉了一大圈，一問起旗子的事，大家就像約好了一樣告訴我，讓我來決定就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，你的決定大家一直都很信服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越是這樣越難，總得拿出一個大家都滿意的方案來，才不算辜負了你們對我的信賴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"簡妮，你知道，就算你做了一面空白的旗幟，大家也不會說什麼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這段時間，你一直為了我們忙前忙後，天不亮就領著人去地塊和林子尋找食物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好不容易回到營地，你也很少休息，總有各項雜事都等著你來處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，大家把旗幟交給你，本質上是想著這樣輕鬆的活計能讓你好好放鬆休息一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣嗎......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，你要是再為了旗幟的事情勞心勞力，豈不是說不過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以剩下的事情就交給我吧，簡妮，你今天早點去睡吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"燭火......它有點暗了，我去把窗子開大些，好讓月光進來得更多些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咦，阿奇頓，你聽到歌聲了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風有些大，可能傳過來有些不清晰，你仔細聽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，聽到了，從哪裡傳來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道......"},{"type":"narration","text":"孤單細弱的歌聲顫顫悠悠地飄在風中，但那些捕捉到它的人，不自覺地都跟著唱和起來。\n於是歌聲漸響，風聲漸弱。直至營地的每個角落，都縈繞著歌聲。\n......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"♪轉瞬便會遠離玫瑰、百合和星塵的侵蝕♪\n♪只要我們是一雙浪尖上的白色羽獸♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是穆麗吧，之前照顧她的時候，我聽到了她在呢喃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"琴柳","speakerId":"avg_479_sleach_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好聽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_barracks"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈......睏死了，外面怎麼回事？好吵啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"德文！過來，快過來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受傷的士兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是簡妮！是簡妮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煩躁的塔拉男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_242","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"擠過紛擁的人群，男人看向營地的空曠處。\n在那裡，迎著晨露和寒風，女孩筆直的身影面對旗杆肅立。\n她穿戴整齊，鬢髮一絲不亂，手裡持著一面捲起的旗幟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"♪但願我們化作一雙白色的羽獸，出沒在浪尖♪\n♪時光會將我們遺忘，悲傷亦不會再臨♪\n♪轉瞬便會遠離玫瑰、百合和星塵的侵蝕♪\n♪只要我們是一雙浪尖上的白色羽獸♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"伴隨女孩的歌聲和她拉動旗繩的動作，旗幟緩緩升上高空，風把旗幟鋪展開來。\n一雙白色羽獸在上面翱翔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
